      "caption": "Your sleep position matters more than you think.\nWhen you sleep on your right side, stomach acid can flow back into the esophagus more easily — increasing heartburn.\nWhen you sleep on your left side, the stomach stays lower than the esophagus, helping keep gastric acid down and reducing reflux symptoms.\nIf you deal with:\n• Nighttime heartburn\n• GERD\n• Bloating after dinner\n• Acid reflux while sleeping\nTry switching to your left side tonight. It’s a simple habit that can improve digestion and sleep quality.\nSave this & follow for more practical health tips.\n#AcidRefluxRelief #GERD #SleepHealth #DigestiveHealth #GutHealth #Heartburn #HealthTok #WellnessTips #HealthyLiving #SleepBetter #NaturalRemedies ",
